## Critical Context Elements
This file serves as a persistent record of critical context that must be maintained across sessions. It contains the essential information needed to reconstruct the development context if it is lost.

### Usage Instructions
1. Update this file after each significant development step
2. Verify consistency with active-working-feature-context.mdc
3. Reference this file when loading context at the start of a new session
4. When inconsistencies are found, use this file to resolve them

### Context Recovery
If context is lost, follow these steps:
1. Load the context from this file
2. Verify actual status by checking test results
3. Update all related files to maintain consistency
4. Document the recovery process 